  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n## 2026-10-15 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-03\n- Added Support for Capture Failed Transaction Status\n\n## 2026-10-06 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-02\n- Modify error message \"Invalid routing number.\"\n\n\n## 2026-10-06 - 10.0.0.4-Beta-01\n-Added Sonar Issue fix\n\n## 2026-10-06 - 10.0.0.3-Beta-03\n\n- Added BindRabbit Feature\n\n## 2026-09-10 - 10.0.0.3-Beta-01\n\n- renamed AMS360 to AMS\n\n## 2026-08-20 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-03\n\n- Added cache-key and expiration validation with structured cache-operation logging.\n\n## 2026-08-18 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-02\n\n- Consolidated cache serialization and expiration into a shared keyed cache service.\n\n## 2026-08-17 - 10.0.0.2-Beta-01\n\n- Synchronized the State service and Misc Cache service changes from develop.\n\n## 2026-08-14 - 10.0.0.1\n\n-  Published the Stable .net 10 compatible version\n\n## 2026-08-13 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-05\n\n-  Updated README.md\n\n## 2026-07-28 - 10.0.0.0-Beta-04\n\n-  Added nullability preprocessor directives for IElasticCache and IRoutingNumberDetailsService.\n\n## 8.0.0.24-Beta-03 - 2026-07-24\n\n- Added the shared State model and GetStatesAsync contract.",
